        {showPolicy && <div className="mt-3 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/15 bg-white/[.04] p-4 text-xs leading-6 text-[#c6c1dc]"><b className="text-amber-100">Draft — pending owner confirmation.</b><br/>Prior appointment; full payment to confirm; one rescheduling request may be permitted with adequate notice; late cancellation or non-attendance may result in loss of booking fee. Refund eligibility depends on the selected service and final published policy. Prepared reports and customised services may not be refundable. No deadline is specified.</div>}
